should make the interaction coherent without encouraging users to overestimate the system's understanding. The best conversational interface is not the one that most closely imitates a person; it is the one that makes capabilities, uncertainty, control, and consequences easy to understand.\n\nTogether, these topics show conversation as an engineered interaction loop. Recognition supplies hypotheses, understanding supplies structure, dialog supplies continuity and action, generation supplies expression, architecture joins the capabilities, and conversational design makes the entire system usable and trustworthy."],[17719,"[[coreblenderdevelopment.pdf]]"],[17728,"[[coreblenderdevelopment.pdf]]"],[17731,"[[coreblenderdevelopment.pdf]]"],[17734,"[[coreblenderdevelopment.pdf]]"],[17737,"[[coreblenderdevelopment.pdf]]"],[17743,"[[coreblenderdevelopment.pdf]]"],[17764,"[[coreblenderdevelopment.pdf]]"],[17767,"[[coreblenderdevelopment.pdf]]"],[17770,"[[coreblenderdevelopment.pdf]]"],[17773,"[[coreblenderdevelopment.pdf]]"],[17776,"[[coreblenderdevelopment.pdf]]"],[17779,"[[coreblenderdevelopment.pdf]]"],[17812,"[[coreblenderdevelopment.pdf]]"],[17824,"[[coreblenderdevelopment.pdf]]"],[17827,"[[coreblenderdevelopment.pdf]]"],[17830,"[[coreblenderdevelopment.pdf]]"],[17860,"[[coreblenderdevelopment.pdf]]"],[17875,"[[coreblenderdevelopment.pdf]]"],[17878,"[[coreblenderdevelopment.pdf]]"],[17884,"[[coreblenderdevelopment.pdf]]"],[17887,"[[coreblenderdevelopment.pdf]]"],[17890,"[[coreblenderdevelopment.pdf]]"],[17893,"[[coreblenderdevelopment.pdf]]"],[17896,"[[coreblenderdevelopment.pdf]]"],[17899,"[[coreblenderdevelopment.pdf]]"],[17902,"[[coreblenderdevelopment.pdf]]"],[17905,"[[coreblenderdevelopment.pdf]]"],[17908,"[[coreblenderdevelopment.pdf]]"],[17920,"[[coreblenderdevelopment.pdf]]"],[17923,"[[coreblenderdevelopment.pdf]]"],[17926,"[[coreblenderdevelopment.pdf]]"],[17929,"[[coreblenderdevelopment.pdf]]"],[17944,"[[coreblenderdevelopment.pdf]]"],[17947,"[[coreblenderdevel